Photos-Go-Round\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 Photos-Go-Round
\f1\b0  is a fast, flexible wallpaper, screensaver and set of widgets which will allow you to show photos from your photo library, or your file system.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa331\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs40 \cf0 Why Photos-Go-Round\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 Photos-Go-Round
\f1\b0  is designed from the ground up to work with large numbers of photos from a variety of sources.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa331\partightenfactor0

